Greetings,

The PWG will hold its May 2018 Face-to-Face Meeting on May 15-17, 2018 in
Sunnyvale, CA at the Wild Palms Hotel. The tentative agenda,
teleconferencing and venue information can be found at the meeting
information page:

https://www.pwg.org/chair/meeting-info/may-2018-sunnyvale.html

This page will be updated with a final agenda and document links as the
material becomes available.

Please visit the May 2018 survey page PRIOR TO April 15, 2018 and indicate
whether you plan to participate:

https://www.surveymonkey.com/r/C5DXRWY

We hope to see you there!

Cheers,
Smith

